                    </zone>
                    <zone forceUpdate='true' h='38281' id='27' type-v2='text' w='32137' x='67277' y='60677'>
                      <formatted-text>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Executive Summary</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Technology is the strongest-performing category, generating $836K in sales and $145K in profit while maintaining the lowest average discount rate. In contrast, Furniture receives the highest discounts (17.4%) but contributes only $18K in profit, suggesting poor discount efficiency. The analysis indicates a negative relationship between discounting and profitability, highlighting Furniture as the primary opportunity for margin improvement. </run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Data Source: </run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Superstore Dataset   </run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Tools:</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> SQL, Tableau </run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Analyst:</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> Aryan Chechi </run>
                      </formatted-text>
                      <zone-style>
                        <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                        <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                        <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                        <format attr='margin' value='4' />
